      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 631163949,
      "version": 212,
      "versionNonce": 1483690776,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770811271640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 资源共享：多个进程之间共享同样的资源。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 资源共享：多个进程之间共享同样的资源。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UM7zIKcVWY1gaH63TI0Yt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -589.3897200828452,
      "y": -9605.364212903953,
      "width": 798.4400024414062,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 564468003,
      "version": 281,
      "versionNonce": 1514483736,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770811271640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 通知事件：⼀个进程需要向另⼀个或⼀组进程发送消息，通知它（它们）发⽣了某种事件\n（如进",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 通知事件：⼀个进程需要向另⼀个或⼀组进程发送消息，通知它（它们）发⽣了某种事件（如进",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ky35k9k-n55D1arCt5PIU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -532.1697188621421,
      "y": -9579.530899915671,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 162446989,
      "version": 206,
      "versionNonce": 1062694168,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770811271640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "程终⽌时要通知⽗进程）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "程终⽌时要通知⽗进程）。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oBu4AVaZ9ZuTpuftyDuw4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -593.1296797996421,
      "y": -9547.030899915671,
      "width": 797.919921875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1015807171,
      "version": 198,
      "versionNonce": 555354648,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770811271640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 进程控制：有些进程希望完全控制另⼀个进程的执⾏（如Debug进程），此时控制进程希\n望能够",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 进程控制：有些进程希望完全控制另⼀个进程的执⾏（如Debug进程），此时控制进程希望能够",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IpwAJ3YVhKlZCUiUpHpLB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -534.8363448387046,
      "y": -9522.530899915671,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 533816557,
      "version": 211,
      "versionNonce": 1249969944,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770811271640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "拦截另⼀个进程的所有陷⼊和异常，并能够及时知道它的状态改变。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "拦截另⼀个进程的所有陷⼊和异常，并能够及时知道它的状态改变。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-Qw9f7voZHRcjxh0elqPZ",
