      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 51661901,
      "version": 180,
      "versionNonce": 1634903011,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770790726507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "管道在设计之初，只允许进行单项数据通信\n所以父子进程各自都会关闭掉自己读写中不需要的那个fd",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "管道在设计之初，只允许进行单项数据通信\n所以父子进程各自都会关闭掉自己读写中不需要的那个fd",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8pSovaDUvN-hDyNPES5AW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -169.50303185042333,
      "y": -6450.030838880515,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1669008035,
      "version": 166,
      "versionNonce": 256868781,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770790786766,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "为什么单向：\n因为这种做法最简单，不然还要考虑多一些，其实就算要两个朝向的我再来个管道呗",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "为什么单向：\n因为这种做法最简单，不然还要考虑多一些，其实就算要两个朝向的我再来个管道呗",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5CIobNMNug4RyPeWD32ta",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -170.83640587386083,
      "y": -6368.697525892234,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b10",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2138975971,
      "version": 139,
      "versionNonce": 666837603,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770790832548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "正是因为天然为了简单，进行单向通信，我们才叫做管道的",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "正是因为天然为了简单，进行单向通信，我们才叫做管道的",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
