      "versionNonce": 1834687806,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770875698998,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 管道的特点之一：基于文件的，单向数据通信",
      "fontSize": 22.45931531791649,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 管道的特点之一：基于文件的，单向数据通信",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lzRPq-JyXu_nli8IKSikS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -793.8419888805017,
      "y": -884.7734249385294,
      "width": 960.6747314756349,
      "height": 28.074144147395614,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b14",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 68309101,
      "version": 1388,
      "versionNonce": 1354810750,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770875698998,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. 管道只能用来让具有血缘关系的进程，进行进程间通信，常用于父子进程之间进行进程间通信 ",
      "fontSize": 22.45931531791649,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 管道只能用来让具有血缘关系的进程，进行进程间通信，常用于父子进程之间进行进程间通信 ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A-ZO3S2qAN8V6FU9fAgiy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -793.8421259612836,
      "y": -838.3575294616321,
      "width": 1511.1076696697512,
      "height": 28.074144147395614,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 612211565,
      "version": 1321,
      "versionNonce": 1103586750,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770875698998,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. 管道的本质是文件，一般文件，如果打开它的进程退出了，那么文件也会被系统自动关闭！打开的文件的生命周期随进程，所以管道的生命周期随进程",
      "fontSize": 22.45931531791649,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. 管道的本质是文件，一般文件，如果打开它的进程退出了，那么文件也会被系统自动关闭！打开的文件的生命周期随进程，所以管道的生命周期随进程",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
